---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const description =
  "Joshua Young is from Cincinnati. He travels solo, studied computer science at Duke, and writes software.";
---

<Base title="About" description={description}>
  <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>I'm from Cincinnati, Ohio.</p>
    <p>
      I have been solo traveling on a budget for a good chunk of the past three years. I have
      explored dozens of countries, focusing on the history, culture, food, and nature of each
      place. Highlights include running the Athens Marathon in Greece, the Everest Base Camp and
      Three Passes trek in Nepal, the 2022 World Cup in Qatar, two weddings in India, and five
      World Wonders: the Colosseum, Chichén Itzá, Machu Picchu, Petra, and the Taj Mahal. I
      celebrated Holi in India and Songkran in Thailand. The adventure has truly been a whirlwind.
    </p>
    <p>
      I studied computer science at Duke and taught CS 250 and CS 310. In high school I was
      president of the Latin Club at Indian Hill and editor of the Ohio Junior Classical League.
    </p>
    <p>
      What I've been building is on the <a href="/work">work page</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
